 displease any one (g.);
 Ⅳ. P. 🞄ruṣya, be angry or vexed, with (g.): pp. 🞄ruṣṭa ruṣita, angry, indignant, enraged, 🞄with (g., lc., prati + ac.);
 cs. roṣaya, P. 🞄(Ā. metr.) irritate, enrage. sam, pp. indignant, 🞄enraged;
